          "topic": "Universal Healthcare",
          "value": "Supports universal healthcare with guaranteed coverage for all Americans, affordable and predictable costs capped based on income, and no gaps or surprises in coverage",
          "snippet": "My vision for Universal Healthcare: Guaranteed Coverage for All: Every American, no exceptions—regardless of age, job, income, or health history. Affordable and Predictable Costs: Caps on premiums, low deductibles, and out-of-pocket costs tied to what families can truly afford—not what insurance companies dictate. No More Gaps or Surprises: All essential treatments, medications, doctor visits, mental health, and prevention are covered."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Social Security and Retirement",
          "value": "Will fight to increase Social Security and entitlements, with ultimate goal to lower the retirement age",
          "snippet": "I will Fight For OUR Entitlements. (Medicare, Medicaid, and Social Security) Republicans want to defund and eliminate these programs that almost 200,000 People in My Florida District 13 Rely on for their basic needs and survival. I WILL FIGHT TO INCREASE SOCIAL SECURITY and ENTITLEMENTS. MY ULTIMATE GOAL is to LOWER the RETIREMENT AGE so we have more time to ACTUALLY ENJOY OUR RETIREMENT that we earned!"
        }
      ],
